<h2 id="h-final-thoughts">Final Thoughts</h2>
<p>The Bear Paw grip is less a single product than a grip philosophy: a full, hand-shaped handle that puts your hand in the same place every time and lets the bow do the work. Whether you shoot a Bear traditional bow or a Bear compound, the goals stay the same: find a wrist angle you can repeat, keep your fingers relaxed and choose a material that suits the conditions you hunt in. Get that right and your groups will tell you.</p>

